{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"b06b4bb56cb35ae6c8ccf3dd2adb925da712d6c84371ff823d13c56a992c8290","digest":{"component_or_area":"gitignore and worktree management","key_entities":[".gitignore",".provision.log","com.navapbc.rebar-worktree-gc",".venv/","__pycache__/",".pytest_cache/",".ruff_cache/"],"problem_keywords":["gitignore","provisioning artifact","worktree gc","untracked file","venv",".provision.log"],"propositions":[".provision.log is an untracked file created during venv provisioning that causes git status --porcelain to remain non-empty, pinning worktrees","worktree GC refuses to reclaim worktrees with non-empty git status, preventing provisioning artifacts from aging out","adding .provision.log to .gitignore as an unanchored pattern will allow git to ignore the file and allow worktrees to be collected","the provisioning artifact is build noise never read after provisioning and never intended for commit"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787878430589674001,"uuid":"8892adb1-c7f7-4217-8d5b-58e015356171"}